@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title C2 — Próspero: recorte da telemetria configurada
rectangle "Próspero — containers locais" {
 rectangle "Front office" as fo <<Container Quarkus>>
 rectangle "Middle office" as mo <<Container Quarkus>>
 rectangle "Matching engine" as me <<Container Quarkus>>
 rectangle "Back office" as bo <<Container Quarkus>>
 rectangle "OpenTelemetry Collector" as o <<Container>>
 rectangle "Jaeger\nTraces em memória" as j <<Container>>
 rectangle "Loki" as l <<Container>>
 rectangle "Prometheus" as p <<Container>>
 rectangle "Grafana" as g <<Container>>
}
fo --> o : OTLP logs/traces
mo --> o : OTLP logs/traces
me --> o : OTLP logs/traces
bo --> o : OTLP logs/traces
o --> j : Traces
o --> l : Logs
p --> fo : GET /q/metrics
p --> mo : GET /q/metrics
p --> me : GET /q/metrics
p --> bo : GET /q/metrics
g --> p : Consulta métricas
g --> j : Consulta traces
g --> l : Consulta logs
legend bottom
Notação C4 local. Recorte dos mesmos serviços do C2 de fundação, sem duplicação de deploy.
Prometheus coleta métricas diretamente; Collector encaminha logs e traces.
Configuração técnica não comprova trace financeiro nem metas RNF medidas.
endlegend
@enduml
